WEBVTT

00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:02.290
W-wait, hold on!

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:05.080
Blood!

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:08.420
Nagomi, please calm down!

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:09.630
No, no, no!

00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:11.000
I'm gonna drown!

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.540
Rankooo!

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:31.250
Welcome home, Master

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:33.330
Welcome home, Mistress

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:38.330
Welcome home, Master

00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:40.290
Welcome home, Mistress

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:43.330
Welcome home, Master

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:45.540
Omelet fully loaded with chicken and rice

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:47.420
Make it yummy, moe moe kyun

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:52.790
With plenty of milk and plenty of love

00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:54.630
Let's cast a spell, moe moe kyun

00:00:58.210 --> 00:01:01.920
Seeing sooo many masters here makes me so happy, oink!

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:03.380
Fresh out of Moe Moe Forest

00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:05.000
This maid's going whole hog, oink!

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.380
Welcome home, Master

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:09.420
Kawaii is justice, oink!

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:12.460
My makeup's just the bomb, like, O.M.G.!

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:15.960
Ramen, extra veggies, topped with sauce, fat, and garlic aplenty

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:18.170
Welcome home to the pigsty!

00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:22.080
Hey! (Yeah!) This is my maid way! (Whoo!)

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:24.830
Shot through your heart like, Boom! Boom! Boom! (Alright!)

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:26.790
Take an instax with the scumbag

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:29.250
Hey! (Yeah!) Maid princesses from Hell! (Whoo!)

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:31.880
Stan for me or, Blam! Blam! Blam! (Okay)

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:33.920
Petticoats whirl in a scuffle

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:35.670
Hide-and-seek at the maid cafe

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:37.380
Nice service for booming sales

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:39.170
Falling in love a big no-no

00:01:39.170 --> 00:01:41.500
A cutesy garden of secrets

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:46.420
Drowning in Red!

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:46.420
A 36th Birthday Celebration!

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:44.210
What?!

00:01:44.210 --> 00:01:46.920
You're going to buy another Oinky Draw ticket?

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:48.460
What a sweet surprise!

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:50.670
Wisdom number one...

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:54.500
Instead of just one person crafting away

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:58.500
With two sets of hands there'll be much more pay

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:02.250
And that, good sir, is the maid way I choose!

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:04.380
Oh, paste away, paste away

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:06.290
Now, wisdom number two...

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:07.290
Um...

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:09.210
Maybe we should stop.

00:02:09.210 --> 00:02:09.830
Why?

00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:10.460
This song's a total downer.
Why?

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:11.750
This song's a total downer.

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:14.290
Oh, paste away, paste away!

00:02:14.290 --> 00:02:15.580
She's still singing.

00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:17.750
Chief, how many more do we make?

00:02:18.130 --> 00:02:20.210
Each one's 0.5 yen...

00:02:20.210 --> 00:02:21.420
So like, a million?

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:22.250
A mi-

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:23.750
It's fine, it's fine!

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:26.080
With five of us on it, it's only 200,000 per person!

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:28.380
You don't wanna give up on the cafe, do you, Nagomi?

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:29.380
Huh?

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:33.420
If we don't pay half a million yen in interest
within the month for our overdue sweets money,

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:34.960
they said we have to close shop.

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:38.210
That's right!
The clock's already ticking!

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:42.790
Now that we're out of ideas, our only chance
is to move our fingers at lightning speed!

00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:44.250
Just a million more!

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:46.040
Make these flowers with all you've got!

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:48.290
The towel has already been thrown!

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:50.000
You mean dice, not towel!

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:56.290
Are those new flyers?

00:02:56.920 --> 00:02:59.540
They look a little different from before.

00:02:59.830 --> 00:03:02.420
Actually, we can't afford to buy ink.

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:07.130
Some cute little pigs live in this brick

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:07.130
house we call Oinky Doink Cafe.

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:07.130
In order to become the finest Iberico pork,

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:07.130
our little piggies eagerly await

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:07.130
all you masters and mistresses.

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:06.670
So we're printing them with
as little ink as possible to get by.

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:09.210
Oh, uh...

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:10.710
That's original!

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:12.250
Th-thanks.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:14.330
Can I ask you something?

00:03:14.330 --> 00:03:15.830
Sure, what is it?

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:19.460
What helps bring money into a cafe?

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:23.580
Let's see, I think events are always effective.

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:24.920
Events?

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:27.540
For example, we have Cosmo Melos Day tomorrow

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:29.630
and next week is Kafka Big Bang Week.

00:03:29.630 --> 00:03:32.380
Events really help to bring customers in.

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:34.920
Wow, that kind of sounds like fun!

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:37.960
A standard one is the birthday event.

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:39.250
Birthday?

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:42.540
Your cafe is part of the Creatureland Group,

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:45.710
so you might be able to ask an affiliated cafe for help.

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:48.080
Oinky Doink Cafe

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:48.080
A birthday event?

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:51.040
Yes! Does anyone have a birthday coming up?

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:53.540
Count me out.
I don't want to tell you my birthday.

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:56.420
Like anyone gets born around this time of year.

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:59.630
Actually, I turn thirty-six in two days.

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:02.170
In two days?!
That's too funny.

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:04.420
You have a birthday, Ranko?

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:06.540
We have no funds!

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:08.500
Use your heads instead of money!

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:09.710
Got that, Ranko?

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:11.250
Understood.

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:13.040
I'll help!

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:15.420
Oinky Doink Cafe

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:16.830
Here, have some grub.

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:19.210
That's all we get again?

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:20.420
It's all we have.

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:22.040
Just be glad it has flavor!

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:24.460
Listen Shiipon, back during the war,

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:26.170
Where are Ranko and Nagomi?
they boiled pumpkin stems and leaves to-

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:28.290
They're planning the event.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:30.750
Will they make it in time?

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:34.380
I came up with an idea for a flyer.

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:36.710
Wow! Can I see it?!

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:38.960
Ranko Mannen's Birthday Celebration

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:38.960
In what we realize are busy times,

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:38.960
we nonetheless invite you to find the time

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:38.960
and join us for this occasion.

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:38.960
Doors open May 9th at 18:00

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:38.960
Oinky Doink Cafe

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:41.750
I realize it lacks impact.

00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:43.830
Uh no, it has plenty of that!

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:45.960
I also considered some potential activities.

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:48.080
•Coin magic •Animal impressions •Solo shiritori

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:48.080
•Voice-delay ventriloquism •Card magic •American duck

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:48.080
impression •Drink juice from a cup with no hands •Impressions

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:48.080
PRIZES?

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:48.080
•Juggling •Groveling hot towel •Tablecloth pull •Air chair squat

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:48.080
•Humiliating belly dance •Magic tricks •Regurgitation trick

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:48.080
•The Human Dance •Loach Scooping Dance •Nankin-tamasudare

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:48.080
•Hanafuda fishing •Hanafuda roppyakken •Hanafuda oichokabu

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:48.080
•Sic bo •Cho-han •Chinchirorin •Choboichi

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:48.080
•Tehonbiki •Tabu •A skit •Bonodori dance

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:51.000
I'm not sure where to insert a coin toss game.

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:53.130
C-coi...tus?

00:04:53.460 --> 00:04:55.750
It's way too early for me!

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:59.290
Sure, I'm intrigued and all, but considering my age...

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:01.750
I don't think age has anything to do
with a game involving a coin.

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:05.830
A-anyway! We can't do everything on the list!

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:07.290
Do you suppose not?

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:16.420
Well, let's take a look and consolidate a bit.

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:17.880
I'll narrow down the list.

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:20.040
Um...

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:25.380
If it's feasible, could we get a cake
or something for Ranko?

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:27.580
A cheap one would do.

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:32.710
We're desperately living off stir-fried bean sprouts.

00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:34.500
You think we have the funds for that?

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:37.580
B-but if the birthday event is popular...

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:39.170
Popular?

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:44.420
Popular!

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:47.500
Who the heck's gonna come celebrate
Ranko's birthday?!

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:49.210
You can do whatever.

00:05:49.210 --> 00:05:52.290
Just don't cause any problems for my regulars.

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:53.830
Problems?

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:56.000
I'm the top earner here.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:59.880
Looking after my masters is what
keeps this place going!

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.330
Isn't that right, Chief?

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:03.790
Why of course it is, Lady Yumechi!

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:08.580
Irrelevant maid birthdays should be
done quietly off in the corner!

00:06:08.580 --> 00:06:09.790
Irrelevant?!

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:11.000
Hold on, Yumechi!

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:12.420
Silence, underling!

00:06:12.420 --> 00:06:15.170
If you want to do it, just do it with the two of you!

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:16.750
But keep making flowers!

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:18.880
I told 'er off good, Lady Yumechi.

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:20.420
But...

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:24.540
Okay, hogheads, time to eat some lunch!

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:26.790
Yuk, yuk, yuk, yuk, yuk!

00:06:26.790 --> 00:06:28.500
That's too funny!

00:06:30.170 --> 00:06:31.630
How could they?!

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:34.000
Oinky Doink Cafe

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:40.000
Happy Birthday

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:41.500
Birthday Celebration

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:43.750
Ranko?!

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:46.080
You woke up?

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:49.500
Yes, I couldn't stop thinking about tomorrow.

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:51.710
Have you been at it this whole time?

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:55.080
I figured I should at least get the decorations done.

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:57.830
W-wow, that's quite impressive.

00:06:58.290 --> 00:07:00.130
Can I help at all?

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:01.750
I appreciate the offer.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:03.880
But I'm just about finished.

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:05.960
I see.

00:07:09.210 --> 00:07:11.000
Birthday Celebration

00:07:09.210 --> 00:07:11.000
Reservations

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:13.920
<i>What can I do...</i>

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:16.540
<i>to get some reservations?</i>

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:20.880
You might be able to ask an affiliated cafe for help.

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:23.790
That's it!

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:26.750
Maid Sheep

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:29.670
Maid Sheep

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:32.250
L-let's go.

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:36.960
Woolly fluff!

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:39.080
Welcome home, Mistress!

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:40.880
Oh, n-no!

00:07:40.880 --> 00:07:44.630
We're from a sister maid cafe, Oinky Doink Cafe.

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:46.580
Oh wow, a comrade of ours!

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:47.880
Y-yes!

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:52.080
We have an event on from 18:00,
and we were hoping to hand out some flyers.

00:07:52.420 --> 00:07:53.630
Miss Kaoruko!

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:55.920
Of course, that's fine.

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:57.920
Oh! Thank you so much!

00:07:57.920 --> 00:08:00.540
Actually, we're a little short-staffed right now.

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:03.880
It would really be nice if you could
help out for just a bit.

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:05.130
Of course we can!

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:06.330
Right, Ranko?

00:08:06.330 --> 00:08:07.790
If my talents will suffice.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:09.170
"Suffice?"!

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:10.830
That's so mature!

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:13.710
It's so lively in here!

00:08:13.710 --> 00:08:14.710
Indeed.

00:08:14.710 --> 00:08:18.830
If even a small percentage of these masters
would stop by on their way home...

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:22.130
E-excuse me!

00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:25.330
We're here from the Oinky Doink Cafe.

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:27.580
A birthday event?

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:28.830
Yes!

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:31.420
Ranko here is celebrating her birthday today!

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:34.790
We have an event on from 18:00,
so if you could stop by...

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:37.000
Is something wrong?

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:40.080
Wow! We have the exact same birthday!

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:43.420
Today is my birthday event!

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:47.670
I'm so happy I have the same birthday
as such a lovely fellow maid!

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:48.880
Woolly fluff!

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.540
Kaoruko, happy birthday!

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:53.920
Happy birthday!

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:56.580
I-I didn't realize.

00:08:56.920 --> 00:08:58.710
Um, I'm very sorry.

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:01.290
How old are you turning, Ranko?

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:02.790
Thirty-six years old.

00:09:02.920 --> 00:09:04.580
Thirty-six?!

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:06.040
Rat, ox, tiger...

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:08.710
Oh wow! Fifteen years older than me!

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:10.380
You must have so much more experience!

00:09:10.670 --> 00:09:13.380
A thirty-six-year-old maid? Yikes!

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:15.000
Talk about ripe!

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:19.960
Oh no, did that make you angry?

00:09:20.130 --> 00:09:21.670
No, not at all.

00:09:21.670 --> 00:09:25.540
I believe age has nothing to do with being a maid.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:30.000
Oh I'm sorry, I wasn't listening at all!

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:31.920
Let's go, Ranko.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:34.000
Oh my, leaving already?

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:36.710
Didn't you want to hand out your flyers?

00:09:36.710 --> 00:09:39.710
These black-and-white flyers with super faint ink?

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:42.710
These...

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:44.080
These have originality!

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:46.330
Very muted originality.

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:47.750
That's fine.

00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:52.250
I think it's a wonderful flyer that shows
how passionate Ranko is.

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:55.750
We should take our leave now.

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:02.830
I'm sorry.

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:04.170
This is all my fault.

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:06.830
No, I appreciated it.

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:10.830
Thank you, for standing up for me.

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:16.630
Actually, I was really worried that you might get mad,

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:18.250
and go on a rampage.

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:21.580
I don't get angry for my own sake.

00:10:22.460 --> 00:10:27.500
If I ever get slightly emotional,
it's only when someone insults the cafe.

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:29.420
The cafe?

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:36.420
Personally, I can't say I'm devoted to
Oinky Doink quite as much yet.

00:10:37.210 --> 00:10:38.790
The others are unfriendly...

00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:42.630
And honestly, I don't want to have to fight.

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:46.080
I know that maids have to fight, but still...

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:52.130
With turf wars intensifying in Akiba now,

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:53.710
Maid Teahouse

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:55.380
I don't think it's realistic to stick to nonviolence.

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:59.330
Ranko, if you intend to live your life as a maid,

00:10:59.330 --> 00:11:01.880
you need to be prepared to take up arms.

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:09.290
So you don't like violence?

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:15.250
It's perfectly fine to be that way.

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:23.540
I once learned...

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:26.750
what you stand to lose unless you fight.

00:11:27.960 --> 00:11:29.380
Please excuse me.

00:11:34.330 --> 00:11:35.630
Wh-what?!

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:37.290
What business do you have?

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:38.830
Filthy pigsty maids!

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:40.580
Think you can get cocky, huh?!

00:11:55.920 --> 00:11:59.580
I thought fighting within the same group
violates our code.

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:02.830
I guess you just pissed me off.

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:06.960
Won't you come with us for a bit, woolly fluff?

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:25.880
It's no use, I can't get out!

00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:27.540
Happy birthday...

00:12:27.710 --> 00:12:29.000
little Miss Ranko!

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:31.420
What is the meaning of this?

00:12:31.630 --> 00:12:34.040
You just had to have the same birthday as me,

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:35.250
silly Ranko.

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:37.080
B-birthday?

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:39.170
So I'm saying,

00:12:39.170 --> 00:12:43.040
we don't need more than
one birthday here in Akiba today.

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:44.790
Don't need?

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:46.920
Everyone was so nice.

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:52.750
The other maids who had the same birthday
all popped and disappeared like pretty bubbles!

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:56.670
Wait, do you mean you killed them all?!

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:58.170
Woolly fluff!

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:01.330
It's almost time, isn't it?

00:13:02.040 --> 00:13:04.830
Your event, you said it starts at 18:00.

00:13:05.670 --> 00:13:06.960
Oh, don't worry!

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:09.960
I'll host your birthday event right here.

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:14.540
Blood?!

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:16.790
It's a birthday present from me.

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:20.830
Wow, your birthday and the day that
you die are going to match!

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:23.500
M-my birthday's on April 2nd!

00:13:23.960 --> 00:13:25.170
So what?

00:13:25.170 --> 00:13:28.210
My birthday won't match the day that I die!

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:31.540
I'm sorry...

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:35.670
Dream of sheep and sleep tight!

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:40.500
W-wait, hold on!

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:43.710
Blood!

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:47.080
Nagomi, please calm down!

00:13:47.080 --> 00:13:48.290
No, no, no!

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:49.580
I'm gonna drown!

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:51.380
Rankoooo!

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:53.920
Tomato?

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:55.670
This is tomato juice!

00:13:55.670 --> 00:13:57.250
Thank goodness!

00:13:58.210 --> 00:13:59.710
What about that is good?

00:14:00.580 --> 00:14:02.960
Nooooo!

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:05.170
Happy Birthday

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:05.170
Ranko!

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:10.750
DORAMA

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:07.670
I put my heart and soul into it.

00:14:07.670 --> 00:14:09.210
It's practically glowing with holy light!

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:11.130
Look at the size of that!

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:12.960
Did you really make this?

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:14.750
I did it for her.

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:16.540
Give her a proper celebration.

00:14:18.130 --> 00:14:19.920
So we managed to buy a cake.

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:22.750
That's why we lived off of bean sprouts, remember?

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:26.130
For better or for worse,
we still have zero masters here.

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:28.210
Let's hide this cake fast and get ready.

00:14:28.710 --> 00:14:32.540
In all honesty, I'm sure we all thought we were busted
with Yumechi's crappy attempt at acting.

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:35.080
I-it's hard trying to act mean!

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:36.130
Anyway!

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:39.670
We're gonna make sure to nail
Ranko's birthday surprise!

00:14:39.670 --> 00:14:40.710
Zoya!

00:14:40.710 --> 00:14:41.920
Right!

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:45.460
Gotcha person, let's pull this off!

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:46.670
That's not quite it!

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:52.210
Ready, and!

00:14:54.460 --> 00:14:56.250
Yes! We made it back up!

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:57.540
We made it!

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:04.210
Do you think we're going to die?

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:06.880
At this rate, we will.

00:15:08.250 --> 00:15:12.250
You know, I always wanted to be a maid.

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:18.630
Even though I was worried whether I
have what it takes, I got hired...

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:22.080
Where do you think I went wrong?

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:25.080
I must apologize.

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:30.830
If only I hadn't been born on this day,
thirty-six years ago.

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:34.960
What?! Today's the important day you were born!

00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:37.920
Don't put yourself down like that!

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:41.130
I don’t deserve such kind words.

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:46.580
You see, I was in the joint until just last year.

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:49.330
So the only thing to look forward to for birthdays

00:15:49.330 --> 00:15:52.420
was a single donut and cafe au lait provided to us.

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:54.210
In the joint?

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:55.420
Yes.

00:15:55.420 --> 00:15:59.000
That's why I was looking forward to
my birthday this year.

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:01.130
J-joint?!

00:16:01.130 --> 00:16:02.330
Like that kind of joint?!

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:03.330
Yes.

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:07.580
Oh, uh, my respects for the time you served.

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:11.080
I'm sorry.

00:16:11.080 --> 00:16:12.330
This is all my fault.

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:13.330
No.

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:14.630
On the contrary,

00:16:14.630 --> 00:16:19.380
planning the event with you was
a very happy time for me.

00:16:20.130 --> 00:16:22.080
Circumstances brought me to the cafe,

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:26.080
but I'm grateful that I got to join Oinky Doink.

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:28.960
Ranko...

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:31.170
Not to worry.

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:33.920
The others will be searching for us.

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:37.500
I really don't think so.

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:46.170
Good evening, I'm Ranko Mannen.

00:16:48.580 --> 00:16:49.750
They're late!

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:52.210
Where the heck are those hogs wasting their time?!

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:54.880
What's the big idea, being late to their own event?!

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:57.790
If they never come back, it'll be too funny.

00:16:58.040 --> 00:17:00.500
Then the cake will be for nothing.

00:17:01.630 --> 00:17:03.750
O-o-of course that wouldn't happen.

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:04.580
Right?

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:07.290
Yeah, no way in hell I'd let that fly!

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:09.080
Is that them?!

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:12.080
Talk about confusing, Okachimachi!

00:17:12.080 --> 00:17:14.500
Hey! Did you see Ranko and Nagomi?

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:18.500
Ranko Mannen's Birthday Celebration

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:18.500
Maid Cafe & Bar

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:18.500
Maid Sheep

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:18.500
Masters and Mistresses, why not come to Maid Sheep

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:18.500
for a soothing woolly fluffy time with us?

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:18.500
Our cute little lambs will delight you with impressive performances

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:18.500
and tons of delicious food made with love!

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:18.290
What's this?

00:17:20.960 --> 00:17:22.880
You mean we should buy ink?

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:25.250
Maid Sheep

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:27.380
Congratulations, Kaoruko!

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:29.080
Happy Birthday!

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:30.880
Thank you!

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:33.790
Thank you, woolly fluff!

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:38.750
S-so heavy!

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:41.460
Nagomi! Hold your mouth up higher!

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:43.130
I-I'm trying!

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:46.710
Allow me.

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:50.540
R-Ranko?!

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:52.000
I'll drink it all down.

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:54.210
What?! That's impossible!

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:59.130
Ranko, I lied earlier.

00:17:59.380 --> 00:18:02.670
Actually, I am glad I got to be a maid,

00:18:02.670 --> 00:18:05.460
that I got to join Oinky Doink.

00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:09.330
Nagomi?!

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:11.000
Nagomi!

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:14.170
Miss Kaoruko,

00:18:14.170 --> 00:18:16.290
we apparently broke a revenue record today!

00:18:16.540 --> 00:18:19.540
Of course! It was my birthday, after all!

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:23.210
Are you out of your minds?!

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:24.420
We're affiliated!

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:25.630
Like we care?

00:18:25.630 --> 00:18:28.130
There's a surprise birthday at stake here!

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:29.710
Who are you?

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:32.830
We don't have the money to buy ink!

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:33.540
What?

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:35.750
Bring out Ranko and Nagomi, damn it!

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:37.670
You want our cake to go to waste?!

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:39.460
Damn swine...

00:18:39.750 --> 00:18:41.750
Sounds like you want to be ground into mince.

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:44.330
Can it! We're friggin' pissed!

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:47.500
I won't let our days of eating only
beansprouts be for nothing!

00:18:47.750 --> 00:18:49.960
I'm holding you all accountable.

00:18:50.330 --> 00:18:52.460
We'll show you what happens

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:55.330
when you take a pig lightly!

00:19:01.750 --> 00:19:04.460
Hello, tomatoes, do you want to play?

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:08.750
Aw, you're so cute!

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:12.420
Gaahhhh!

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:14.880
There!

00:19:18.250 --> 00:19:19.250
Nagomi!

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:20.500
Nagomi!

00:19:24.420 --> 00:19:25.250
Nagomi?!

00:19:25.250 --> 00:19:26.250
Ranko!

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:28.540
You both alive?! Let's go!

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:31.000
You caused us a major hassle, man!

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:32.580
We get out of here, now.

00:19:32.670 --> 00:19:34.500
I... I'm so sorry...

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:38.670
Bloooood!

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:40.380
Nagomi, are you all right?

00:19:40.380 --> 00:19:41.380
Nagomi?!

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:45.790
So, like, what do we do about this?

00:19:46.130 --> 00:19:47.880
What the hell do I care?

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:49.830
They had it coming to them.

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:53.290
Y-you're finished, the lot of you.

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:57.630
Th-the Creatureland Group won't let this slide.

00:19:58.420 --> 00:20:02.130
They'll end your cafe,
and you can die in the gutter, swine!

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:03.420
Are you kidding me?

00:20:03.420 --> 00:20:06.380
You scumbags kidnapped the
two of them in the first place!

00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:08.580
Me or that maid...

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:12.040
Who do you think offers more value to the group?

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:17.830
I'm saying that shabby old bag
doesn't cut it as a maid!

00:20:18.130 --> 00:20:20.330
I'm the one the group needs!

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:23.170
That shitty maid can't hope to bring in customers-

00:20:31.920 --> 00:20:33.750
Who you calling shabby?

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:36.960
There are no shitty maids, not in our cafe.

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:43.880
A very happy birthday to you.

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:57.710
A maid missing out on her own event?
It's unbelievable!

00:20:58.460 --> 00:20:59.750
I apologize.

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:01.250
No, I'm the one-

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:03.830
If you wanna apologize, say it to the chief first!

00:21:03.830 --> 00:21:07.170
She ended up managing the whole thing by herself.

00:21:09.710 --> 00:21:11.460
Hurry and get inside first.

00:21:12.210 --> 00:21:13.460
O-okay...

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:17.790
Oh, the lights...

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:22.210
Happy birthday to you!

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:25.960
Happy birthday to you!

00:21:26.210 --> 00:21:30.380
Happy birthday dear Ranko

00:21:30.880 --> 00:21:35.080
Happy birthday to you!

00:21:35.630 --> 00:21:37.540
Happy 36th birthday!

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:40.540
Everyone!

00:21:40.540 --> 00:21:42.540
Why are you crying, Nagomi?

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:44.880
I-I'm not crying!

00:21:46.130 --> 00:21:47.830
The cake is smaller!

00:21:49.380 --> 00:21:50.420
Yo...

00:21:50.420 --> 00:21:51.460
Dipshit...

00:21:52.960 --> 00:21:54.630
No, you've got it wrong!

00:21:54.630 --> 00:21:55.830
You went and ate it?!

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:57.920
Pull what you ate outta your gut!

00:21:57.920 --> 00:21:59.580
I didn't eat any!
You kidding me?!

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:01.210
No, it was a taste test, y'know?!
For poison!

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:02.880
<i>Today, for the first time,</i>

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:06.000
<i>I've found that there are people in this town...</i>

00:22:08.750 --> 00:22:10.290
<i>...who I truly cherish.</i>

00:22:10.920 --> 00:22:13.670
Kirakira kawaiku zettai! Kirameku watashi ni shoutai!
Sparkly and cute to the prime! Come to me I'm sublime!

00:22:13.670 --> 00:22:16.630
Zendai mimon no showtime! Understand?
Unprecedented showtime! Understand?

00:22:16.790 --> 00:22:22.670
Kokokara hajimaru Cinderella story
This is where my Cinderella story starts, right here

00:22:22.920 --> 00:22:24.670
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:22:24.880 --> 00:22:27.330
Suteki na lady no how to
Here's how to become a lady with charms

00:22:27.330 --> 00:22:30.170
Kagami ni tonaeruno
Look in the mirror, chant a spell

00:22:30.170 --> 00:22:32.750
Smart ni? Elegance ni?
You have to be smart and elegant too

00:22:32.750 --> 00:22:34.670
Nanoni real dewa chou magyaku
But in reality I'm completely different

00:22:34.670 --> 00:22:35.670
Doushiyou!
What do I do?

00:22:36.420 --> 00:22:40.130
Aa koi ni yume ni yokubari ga tomaranai
Oh, romance and dreams, I want it all

00:22:40.130 --> 00:22:42.420
Ochikomu hima nante gozaimasen!
I don't have the time to be feeling down

00:22:42.710 --> 00:22:45.380
Datte maid in onnanoko
Becuase I'm "maid" to be a girl

00:22:46.250 --> 00:22:49.290
Tsumari ichi ni aikyou ni ni dokyou san ni benkyou
Which means, be caring, be daring, and be persevering

00:22:49.290 --> 00:22:50.290
Nanchatte
Or whatever

00:22:50.290 --> 00:22:53.040
Dareyorimo happy na jinsei ni non-stop mou dash
To have the happiest life, it's a non-stop mad dash

00:22:53.290 --> 00:22:58.000
Kyou koso shuyaku ni step up!
Today I step up to become the lead!

00:22:53.670 --> 00:22:55.710
Wh-wh-wh-where did you get this?!

00:22:57.000 --> 00:23:00.000
No, I'm not going to ask.

00:22:58.170 --> 00:23:00.040
Kamisama onegai!
So please, God!

00:23:00.040 --> 00:23:02.460
Mugendai! Hajiketai!
Unlimited! Wanna go wild!

00:23:00.290 --> 00:23:02.790
What goes around comes around, you know?

00:23:02.460 --> 00:23:05.420
Onnanoko dakara
'Cause I'm a girl after all

00:23:02.790 --> 00:23:03.790
So it's fine?!

00:23:03.790 --> 00:23:05.000
You're okay with this?!

00:23:05.000 --> 00:23:06.500
'Cuz I'm not giving it back!

00:23:05.420 --> 00:23:08.380
Itsumo shijou saikou o koushin
Every day is an all-time high

00:23:06.830 --> 00:23:09.080
You're great! Such a great panda!

00:23:08.380 --> 00:23:11.580
Ichinenjuu ga anniversary nano
Fresh new anniversaries all year round

00:23:09.080 --> 00:23:10.630
You could make it up in Ueno!

00:23:10.630 --> 00:23:13.330
Your practically Ueno, Okachimachi!

00:23:11.580 --> 00:23:14.330
Souteigai no trouble datte joyful
Even the unexpected is joyful

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:16.710
Zenbu ga romance o hikitateru spice
Something that spices up romance

00:23:14.580 --> 00:23:17.500
Oh, those are the proceeds from Maid Sheep.

00:23:16.710 --> 00:23:19.540
Junbi wa dekitemasu
I'm all ready to go

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:18.830
Maid Sheep?

00:23:19.080 --> 00:23:20.420
Yes, sorry.

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:23.420
Hai! Shinumade isshou onnanoko sengen
Yes! I declare I'm a girl for life, 'til I die!

00:23:20.790 --> 00:23:22.830
We went and wiped out Maid Sheep.

00:23:25.500 --> 00:23:26.790
Dokidoki de harahara de
So exciting, what a thrill!

00:23:26.790 --> 00:23:28.170
Mainichi busy! Oh my god!
Every day busy, oh my god!

00:23:28.170 --> 00:23:29.460
Kirakira de wakuwaku de
So much sparkle, heart a-glow!

00:23:29.460 --> 00:23:30.960
Kimochi wa eien ni seventeen
Inside I always feel seventeen

00:23:30.960 --> 00:23:32.250
Dokidoki de harahara de
So exciting, what a thrill!

00:23:32.250 --> 00:23:33.670
Meiwaku sorry! Goaikyou!
Sorry for the trouble, it's part of the fun!

00:23:33.670 --> 00:23:35.040
Kirakira de wakuwaku de
So much sparkle, heart a-glow!

00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:36.710
Subete ni koisuru pretty heart!
A pretty heart does it all!

00:23:36.710 --> 00:23:38.500
Aishite
Love me do!
